# Leyline of Punishment: "If this card is in your opening hand, you may begin the game with it on the battlefield" (CR 103.6a):
# Bot1 accepts. "Players can't gain life" (CR 119.7): on turn 2 Bot2's Lightning Helix deals 3 to Bot1 and gains Bot2 nothing.
# Bot2 then casts The One Ring and has protection from everything until its next turn (CR 702.16j), which would prevent all
# damage to it; but "Damage can't be prevented" (CR 615.12): on turn 3 Bot1's Fiery Confluence deals 2 damage to each opponent
# three times, and Bot2 is dealt all 6. (The control, where the protection prevents damage:
# the-one-ring-protects-its-caster-from-everything-until-their-next-turn.)

